---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us | Free Invoice Generator" description="Learn about our free, privacy-first invoice generator for freelancers.">
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8">About Us</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>
        We built this invoice generator because we were tired of tools that promise to be free, only to hide your PDF download behind a signup wall or plaster a watermark on your professional document.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        This is a completely free, privacy-first invoice generator designed specifically for freelancers, contractors, and small businesses. 
      </p>

      <h3>Privacy First. Always.</h3>
      <p>
        Unlike traditional SaaS applications, our platform operates entirely client-side. When you input your business name, client details, and financial line items into our template, <strong>that data never touches our remote servers</strong>. 
      </p>
      
      <p>
        All processing and document rendering happens instantly and securely right inside your own web browser. No signup required. No accounts. No tracking. Just a fast, reliable tool to help you get paid.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">&larr; Back to the Invoice Generator</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
